  fullText: I am the only one left. All water is nearly gone.\nI have prepared a
    capsule that should hopefully maintain my body\nintact for a very long time.\nIt
    is unlikely that anyone will find us down here, but it is the only thing I\ncan
    think of.\n\nThis is simply sad. A sad way to go.
